  "title": "Rentals.ca Apartments, Condos and Houses for Rent Across Canada",
  "bodyText": "It's Time to Move\nThousands of apartments, houses, and condos for rent across Canada.\nNew Apartments for Rent\nSee All Recently Added Rentals\nPopular Cities\nFind your next apartment for rent anywhere in Canada.\nToronto\n\n\nCalgary\n\n\nEdmonton\n\n\nOttawa\n\n\nWinnipeg\n\n\nMontréal\n\n\nVancouver\n\n\nQuébec City\n\n\nHamilton\n\n\nSaskatoon\n\n\nLondon\n\n\nHalifax\n\n\n\nWith 65,664 rentals currently available, you're sure to find a great place to live.\n\nPopular Rental Searches\nCalgary\n1 bedroom apartments in Calgary\n2 bedroom apartments in Calgary\nRooms for rent in Calgary\nShort term rentals in Calgary\nEdmonton\n1 bedroom apartments in Edmonton\n2 bedroom apartments in Edmonton\nRooms for rent in Edmonton\nShort term rentals in Edmonton\nMontréal\n1 bedroom apartments in Montréal\n2 bedroom apartments in Montréal\nRooms for rent in Montréal\nShort term rentals in Montréal\nLondon\n1 bedroom apartments in London\n2 bedroom apartments in London\nRooms for rent in London\nShort term rentals in London\nMississauga\n1 bedroom apartments in Mississauga\n2 bedroom apartments in Mississauga\nRooms for rent in Mississauga\nShort term rentals in Mississauga\nOttawa\n1 bedroom apartments in Ottawa\n2 bedroom apartments in Ottawa\nRooms for rent in Ottawa\nShort term rentals in Ottawa\nToronto\n1 bedroom apartments in Toronto\n2 bedroom apartments in Toronto\nRooms for rent in Toronto\nShort term rentals in Toronto\nVancouver\n1 bedroom apartments in Vancouver\n2 bedroom apartments in Vancouver\nRooms for rent in Vancouver\nShort term rentals in Vancouver\nWinnipeg\n1 bedroom apartments in Winnipeg\n2 bedroom apartments in Winnipeg\nRooms for rent in Winnipeg\nShort term rentals in Winnipeg\nExplore all popular searches\nThis website uses cookies to ensure you get the best experience on our website. By clicking \"Allow All\", you consent to our use of cookies. Privacy Policy ↗\nManage Cookies\nDecline\nAllow All",
